{"title":"Meetily Pro 1.8.2 - Speaker Diarisation & a Fresh Interface Release Notes | Meetily","blocks":{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"section","id":"page-intro","children":[{"type":"h1","text":"Meetily Pro 1.8.2 - Speaker Diarisation & a Fresh Interface"},{"type":"p","text":"July 22, 2026"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"a","text":"Skip to main content","href":"#main"},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h2","text":"Release Highlights"},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"July 22, 2026"}]}]},{"type":"p","text":"Meetily now identifies each speaker and labels who said what - live as you record and on audio you import or re-transcribe - wrapped in a cleaner, faster interface with steadier recordings."},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Speaker Diarisation labels who said what, live and on imported or re-transcribed audio"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Rename a speaker once and it updates everywhere across the transcript"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Merge duplicate speakers into a single identity"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Refreshed sidebar, title bar, and settings for easier navigation"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Stability fixes across recording, transcription, summaries, and speaker attribution"}]}]}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"summary","text":"Table of Contents"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h2","text":"What's New in Pro 1.8.2","id":"whats-new-in-pro-182"},{"type":"p","text":"This release brings Speaker Diarisation to Meetily. Your transcript now shows who said what, so a meeting reads like a conversation instead of one long block of text. It's wrapped in a cleaner, faster interface and a round of stability fixes that make recording more dependable."},{"type":"h2","text":"Speaker Diarisation","id":"speaker-diarisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Meetily now identifies each speaker and labels your transcript with who said what."},{"type":"ul","children":[{"type":"li","text":"Live and after the fact - Speakers are attributed on the go as you record, and on audio you import or re-transcribe."},{"type":"li","text":"Rename once, updates everywhere - Give a speaker a real name and it applies across the entire transcript automatically."},{"type":"li","text":"Merge duplicates - If the same person gets split into two, merge them back into a single speaker."},{"type":"li","text":"Better summaries - Knowing who said what helps Meetily produce clearer, more accurate summaries."}]},{"type":"h2","text":"A Cleaner, Faster Interface","id":"a-cleaner-faster-interface"},{"type":"p","text":"A refreshed sidebar, title bar, and settings make Meetily easier to navigate and quicker to get around."},{"type":"h2","text":"Stability & Reliability","id":"stability--reliability"},{"type":"p","text":"A range of fixes across recording, transcription, summaries, and speaker attribution for a smoother, more dependable experience."},{"type":"h2","text":"Upgrade","id":"upgrade"},{"type":"p","text":"The app will prompt you to update via the in-app update dialog. Click \"Update Now!\" to install. All existing settings, recordings, and models are preserved."},{"type":"h2","text":"Download","id":"download"},{"type":"ul","children":[{"type":"li","text":"macOS (Apple Silicon): Download .dmg\n(opens in new tab)"},{"type":"li","text":"Windows: Download .exe\n(opens in new tab)"}]},{"type":"p","text":"If the links above are slow or blocked on your network, use the alternative hosts:"},{"type":"ul","children":[{"type":"li","text":"